### def abs       -> Rational
{: since="1.9.1"}
### def magnitude -> Rational
{: since="1.9.1"}

`self` の絶対値（absolute value）を返します。

```ruby title="例"
p Rational(1, 2).abs   # => (1/2)
p Rational(-1, 2).abs  # => (1/2)
```

